# 47. MVP DEFINITION OF DONE

The MVP is ready when a new user can:

1. Create an account
2. Define who they want to become
3. Select life priorities
4. Create goals
5. Convert goals into habits
6. Build a routine
7. See their daily plan
8. Complete daily actions
9. Track consistency
10. Make a daily promise
11. Reflect at the end of the day
12. Review weekly progress
13. Add enjoyable life experiences
14. Reset their routine after falling behind
15. Understand how their daily actions connect to their long-term identity

---

# 48. THE ONE-SENTENCE PRODUCT DEFINITION

> **HER is a personal life operating system that turns the person you want to become into the small actions you can consistently practice today.**

**Build for identity.
Design for consistency.
Leave room for life.**
